# Injected by entrypoint.sh at render time (2.12f / ADR 0046),
# ephemeral on a real cluster. test-inject.sh scrubs these after each
# run; gitignore is a belt-and-suspenders guard so an interrupted run
# can't leave them staged.
#
# One file at the fixture ROOT with UNANCHORED patterns, rather than one
# per package directory as the single-bundle fixtures use: this fixture
# is deliberately rendered from three different working directories
# (services/api, services/web, and the ambiguous root), and a pre-ADR-0063
# entrypoint — which stayed at the root and injected there — drops them
# at the root too.
cue.mod/
apprafter_claim_gen.cue
